"{\"url\":\"https://registry.isometric.com/project/prj_1K9A90ZPH1S0ZJ9S\",\"title\":\"Miombo Renewal — Isometric\",\"head\":[\"UNDER VALIDATION\",\"BIOSPHERE\",\"Miombo Renewal\",\"Carbon Ventures Africa\",\"->\",\"PROJECT DETAILS\",\"Expected first certificates\",\"2027\",\"Project code\",\"GG0F\",\"Crediting period\",\"01 Jan 2021 to 31 Dec 2070\"],\"issued_header\":null,\"buffer_header\":null,\"crediting\":null,\"verifier\":null,\"code\":\"GG0F\",\"approval\":\"Expected 2027\",\"protocol_current\":\"Reforestation v1.1\",\"protocol_baseline\":null,\"cert_issued\":null,\"cert_retired\":null,\"cert_buffer\":null,\"reversal\":null,\"showing\":[\"Showing 3 of 3\"],\"tables\":[{\"heads\":[\"Submission date\",\"Title\",\"Download\"],\"rows\":[[\"08 Mar 2026\",\"Public Comment Period Summary\",\"PDF | ->\"],[\"08 Mar 2026\",\"Public Comment Period\",\"PDF | ->\"],[\"06 Feb 2026\",\"PDD\",\"PDF | ->\"]]}],\"links\":[{\"h\":\"https://carbonventures.africa\",\"t\":\"Carbon Ventures Africa\"},{\"h\":\"/protocol/reforestation/1.1\",\"t\":\"Reforestation v1.1\"},{\"h\":\"/supplier/spl_1K99QE48S1S0R1JG\",\"t\":\"Learn more\"},{\"h\":\"https://registry.isometric.com/standard#validation-and-verification-process\",\"t\":\"Isometric Standard\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1K99QE48S1S0R1JG/prj_1K9A90ZPH1S0ZJ9S/pjd_1KMD00J231S0G6YY/public_comment_period_summary.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1K99QE48S1S0R1JG/prj_1K9A90ZPH1S0ZJ9S/pjd_1KKTYP26J1S0DAX1/public_comment_period.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"},{\"h\":\"https://storage.googleapis.com/isometric--production--eu--public-documents/spl_1K99QE48S1S0R1JG/prj_1K9A90ZPH1S0ZJ9S/pjd_1KGSVBYEA1S08Q0D/pdd.pdf\",\"t\":\"PDF | ->\"}],\"text\":\"UNDER VALIDATION\\nBIOSPHERE\\nMiombo Renewal\\nCarbon Ventures Africa\\n->\\nPROJECT DETAILS\\nExpected first certificates\\n2027\\nProject code\\nGG0F\\nCrediting period\\n01 Jan 2021 to 31 Dec 2070\\nPROTOCOL DETAILS\\nCurrent protocol version\\nReforestation v1.1\\nAccreditation\\nSummary\\n\\nMiombo Renewal is a project that restores large areas of degraded miombo woodlands in the DR Congo through direct planting and assisted natural regeneration. Led by Carbon Ventures Africa, in partnership with local communities, the University of Lubumbashi and experienced local NGOs, the project removes carbon while enhancing biodiversity, soil health, water regulation and creating sustainable livelihoods for rural communities.\\n\\nDemocratic Republic of the Congo\\nHow carbon is being removed\\n\\nBiosphere carbon dioxide removal (CDR) harnesses the natural capacity of terrestrial and near-coastal ecosystems to absorb and store carbon for extended periods. These pathways utilize the biological processes of forests, soils, wetlands, and other ecosystems to capture carbon dioxide from the atmosphere and sequester it in biomass, soil organic matter, and sediments. Approaches to biosphere CDR include Reforestation, Agroforestry, Improved Forest Management, Mangrove Restoration, Peatland Restoration, and Soil Carbon Enhancement. Biosphere pathways often provide many co-benefits around the protection and enhancement of biodiversity alongside sustainable development for local communities.\\n\\nLearn more\\nProject timeline\\nCompleted 2025\\nInitial documentation submission\\nCompleted 07 Mar 2026\\nPublic comment period\\nCompleted 2026\\nAudit kick-off\\nExpected 2026\\nIN PROGRESS\\nSite visit\\n\\nIsometric’s qualified VVB conducts a site visit, comparing the project facility against the documentation provided. The required cadence for site visits is defined in the Isometric Standard.\\n\\nExpected 2026\\nApproval date\\nExpected 2027\\nInitial credit issuance\\nProject documentation\\nSubmission date\\tTitle\\tDownload\\n08 Mar 2026\\tPublic Comment Period Summary\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n08 Mar 2026\\tPublic Comment Period\\tPDF\\n->\\n\\n06 Feb 2026\\tPDD\\tPDF\\n->\\nShowing 3 of 3\\nPrevious\\nNext\"}"